 |  [ TABELA VISUAL DE CAPACIDADES ]                                            |
 |  +---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+  |
 |  | Component Range           | 01005, 0201, 0402 ... até 150mm conectores |  |
 |  +---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+  |
 |  | IC Package Support        | BGA, uBGA (0.3mm), QFN, CSP, PoP, LGA      |  |
 |  +---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+  |
 |  | Max PCB Size              | 510mm x 460mm (L) / Espessura 0.4mm-4mm    |  |
 |  +---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+  |
 |  | Inspection (QA)           | 100% 3D SPI (Pasta) + 100% 3D AOI (Solda)  |  |
 |  +---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+  |
